How to get an Anthropic API key
Go to https://console.anthropic.com
Sign in (or sign up) — use the same account you'd use for billing.
In the left sidebar (or top-right menu), click API Keys
Direct link: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
Click Create Key (top right).
Give it a name (e.g. "Liam app") and click Create.
Copy the key immediately — it starts with sk-ant-.... You can only see it once. If you lose it, you just make a new one.




